<p><b>Zherron's Bio:</b>
<table border=1 width=400>
  <tr><td>
       No King is so mighty, no preist so holy, no virgin so pure at heart that their blood would not freeze before the face of The Black Tiger Knight!  
     I am the battler of dragons, the darkness of the night.  Look upon me and tremble.  Before me, you are as nothing.  I am darkness and light, the shadow hunter and king of the night.  My claws hold the earth, my tongue tastes the sky.  I am steadfast and strong, I am a Knight of Shadows and to my Lord Innoruuk, I am wed!-----The Black Tiger Knight----
<ooc> I wrote this next short story as means for others to perceive Zherron and how he behaves as I do.  It takes place between Zherron and Zherriin his younger brother.  FYI:  Karahan is a Turkish word meaning Dark King/Knight.  I hope you enjoy reading it as much as I did writing it.  (Damn server was down what the hell else was I supposed to do with my time?!)
     "Enter and be seated young novice and I shall tell thee a tale"  Zherron grins evilly with a slight hint of madness in his eyes at you.  His teeth all filed to sharp points and the same with his finger nails.  "I am Zherron Karahan, Knight of Shadows, Loyal Hand of my Lord Innoruuk  and Servant of the Horde."  As you take in the sparse room at first glance, you see a bed neatly made and a blanket folded upon a chest at the foot of it.  Above the head of the bed is nailed the unholy symbol of Innoruuk.  Next to the bed you see hangs a Cat of Nine Tails at the end are attached to each tail, a shard of glass.  (Some with dried pinkish material still on them.)  The stone walls are bare except for the one opposite of the bed which hangs various weapons and torturing devices from lands near and far.  "Which tale would you like me to weave for thee young brother?  One of the world we abide in or that of  a fairies tale?"  Stops and ponders his statement for a moment.  "Or is there truely a difference between the two?"  (Stating this with a serious expression)  He motions you in and towards an iron-wooden chair.  As you sit, you notice beside you is an ancient wooden table which it appears he uses for his desk.  Upon it sits an iron candle-umbra (obviously well used) some books which are held up by a grimacing skull (one appears to be human the other possiblely a high elves) on either side, a quil and ink bottle, an ancient tome, a brass tray with two glasses and a bottle of some kind of alchoholic beverage it appears.  With a sinister smile Zherron states  "Perhaps there is something thoust would  like me to tell thee, hmmmm, boy?"  Leaning over the desk before sitting down he grabs  the bottle of  blood red liquid and poors two glasses setting one infront of you and taking a sip from his glass all the while disecting your soul with his penetrating eyes.
    "I can see that thy Lord Innoruuk is quite pleased in thee Zherrin and so am I.  Thou shall make a fine cleric indeed!"  Glancing behind the door you see a stand which holds your brothers Dark Forge armor and his sword Tiger's Bane. a Dark Reaver that has been passed down in the family from the greatest Shadow Knight to the next.  "I called thee here to present thee with a gift for thine's inauguration into the Guild of his Lord Innoruuk's Preist's and Preistesses."  Rising up he goes to the bedside and kneels be fore it, taking out a large clothed wrap item.  Rising he turns around and reverently offers it to you.  "Take this young Zherriin, it was thine Grandmothers and her grandfathers before that.  It was hand crafted by our family generations ago and has now became thine own."  Looking at you with a mad smile playing on his face you take the offered gift. Unwrapping it to find an ancient Tier Dal armor breast plate.  Handling it with great care you turn it over and inside is engraved in ancient Tier Dal a prayer to Innoruuk.  "I make thee this sworn promise before our Lord, Zherriin.  That if thoust dus show a true heart for M'Lord Innorruuk and are true to Him, in thine 13th season I will present thee with the rest of this armor.  So that thou'llst may bring our family pride and honor in battle and serve Lord Innoruuk with thy full protential!"  Clenching his fist and eyes full of the madness for his lord.  Zherron let's out a mighty (if not mad) laugh and howls!   "BLOODHORDE!!!!"
Composing himself in a second later he castes his eyes back upon you. "Now you must be off and run those errands that thine older sister Angelc has for you in the Foreign District."  Placing his hand upon your shoulder in a clear meaning to get up and leave. (Before you can stammer out a thank you.)   He opens the door for you, spinning you around before you have a chance to get away.  Grasping your shoulder with one hand in a death like grip and raising a finger before your face.  He stares into your soul with the eyes of a Tier Dal and with what can only be explained as the fever of an unholy knight and states   "Remeber this, use everyone and never be used.  Control all situations. Let them perceive thee as being ignorant if thou must.  Let them that are weak serve thee in thine endevours and those that are strong and in thine way manipulate  them against the enemies that are stronger than thee. For it is thee that they serve Boy and by serving thee, they serve our Lord Innoruuk!   And Zherriin.......(smiles evilly placing his hand over your heart.)  May Hate be thy guide!"  He says in a smooth mad whisper and closees the door.
